#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes.rst:385
msgid ""
"The Kubernetes Cluster Detail page provides a high degree of monitoring "
"and control over Kubernetes Clusters. This includes monitoring of all "
"nodes in the Cluster, ``kubectl`` command line, account and role control,"
" workload management, and more. The upper section of the page (which is "
"persistent regardless of the currently-selected tab) provides high level "
"costing and monitoring information, including a current aggregate metric "
"for the CPU, memory and storage use."
msgstr ""

